msgid "Majima-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3416\t3568"
msgid ""
"Why the stern face, Kiryu-chan?\\n"
"I didn't spook ya, did I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3576\t3617"
msgid "What is all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3618\t3738"
msgid "Oh, just my chaperones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3753\t3939"
msgid ""
"World's so upside-down, it ain't even safe\\n"
"keeping your office above ground anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3983\t4076"
msgid "But the Majima Family's arms are wide open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4077\t4205"
msgid ""
"So. How 'bout we take this\\n"
"somewhere a little more private?"
msgstr ""